#. Accessible name of a profile's button in the title bar while its inbox has unread mail, read by screen readers: the profile's name, then how many messages are unread
#: src/shell/titlebar.tsx
msgid "{count, plural, one {{name}, # unread message} other {{name}, # unread messages}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {{name}, # unread message} other {{name}, # unread messages}}"

#. Title of the one notification for several emails that arrived at once in a profile, which opens its inbox when clicked
#: src/main/notifications.ts
msgid "{count, plural, one {# new message} other {# new messages}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# new message} other {# new messages}}"

#. Read out by a screen reader for the unread badge on Meru's taskbar button on Windows
#: src/main/badge.ts
msgid "{count, plural, one {# unread message} other {# unread messages}}"
msgstr "{count, plural, one {# unread message} other {# unread messages}}"

#. Item in the Do Not Disturb menu that holds notifications for this many hours
#: src/main/commands.ts
